
-- R15 AVATAR CHANGER - LOCAL WELD OVERLAY
-- Keeps the original player rig and its Motor6Ds intact.
-- Creates a separate avatar rig, aligns matching body parts,
-- welds each overlay part to the corresponding player part,
-- disables overlay Motor6Ds AFTER welding, then disables collisions.
-- Copies body proportions and locomotion animation IDs locally.

